{"text": "Dr. Sharon Brown-Welty\n\nEDUCATION\n\nEd.D. University of Pittsburgh, Higher Education Administration and Policy Studies\nDissertation: A Study of the Effects of Decision Variables on Evaluation\nUtilization (Committee: Tony Eichelberger, Laura Leviton,\nWilliam Bickel and Glenn Nelson)\nGraduated: April 1992\n\nMBA Indiana University of Pennsylvania\nGraduated: December 1986\nBSBA Indiana University of Pennsylvania, Business Administration\n\nGraduated: June, 1983\nEXPERIENCE\n\nSelect Summary: Dean, Graduate Studies, Associate Provost, Assistant Provost, Associate Vice\nPresident for Academic Affairs, Assistant to the Vice President for Finance, Director Doctoral\nProgram in Educational Leadership, CSU Director Joint Doctoral Program in Educational\nLeadership, Director Center for Research, Evaluation, Assessment and Dissemination (CREAD),\nDepartment Chair, Educational Research and Administration, Professor, Education\nAdministration.\n\nAdministrative Positions (Chronological Order)\n\nAssociate Director, Doctoral Program in Educational Leadership (DPELFS) \u2014 California\nState University, Fresno (July, 2013 \u2014 Present)\n\nShared Responsibilities with the Director:\n\nAppoint doctoral faculty to Graduate Group (23 members)\nSelect faculty to teach courses and advise students\nOversee the student recruitment and selection process (24 per year)\nDevelop and implement policies\nDevelop and monitor the program budget (Approx. $1.1 million when at full capacity\n(72 students) \u2014 program is self-sustaining program\nOversee student and program outcomes assessment process\nOversee program review process\nOversee program accreditation processes for doctoral program\nProvide leadership for all Graduate Group faculty committees (e.g., Membership,\nCurriculum, Academic Policy and Planning, and Admissions)\nServe on Dean\u2019s Executive and Coordinating Committees\ne Oversee the Doctoral Program in Educational Leadership on the CSU Bakersfield\ncampus\n\nDean, Graduate Studies \u2014 California State University, Fresno (June 2011 \u2014 July 2013)\n\n1 Sharon Brown-Welty\nCurriculum Vitae\nFebruary, 2014",
